          <h1 data-id="pg068_n0003" class="adt-h2 text-left font-bold">Veprimtaria 5: &#x201c;Festojm&#xeb; Pavar&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s!&#x201d;</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b-4 border-purple-400 px-6 py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-3"></div>
