      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg068_n0018">P&#xeb;r fest&#xeb;n e Pavar&#xeb;sis&#xeb; s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s, zbukuroni klas&#xeb;n me flamurin e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span></p>
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg068_n0019">Vishuni me ngjyrat e flamurit: e kalt&#xeb;r, e bardh&#xeb;, e verdh&#xeb;.</span></p>
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg068_n0020">D&#xeb;gjoni himnin e Kosov&#xeb;s dhe ngrihuni n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb; si shenj&#xeb; respekti ndaj vendit ton&#xeb;.</span></p>
